plain operator stream: the stored recipe recomputed on the rows
  join plain == stored: True
  group plain == stored: True
  batch plain == stored: True
  fn    plain == stored: True | content equal True

duplicates
  raw stream with a repeated row: ids 3 distinct 2
  function over it (tags a,a,b, one input value): ids 3 distinct 2

system tags only: do they name every row?
  join 4 columns, unique True
  group 2 columns, unique True
  batch 2 columns, unique True

source id of the origin inside the key: rename an upstream source
  entry ids equal after renaming the source: False
